":"天宝伏妖录","overview":"天宝十二年，不谙世事的英俊少年孔鸿俊，肩负三项重任离开太行山上的曜金宫，来到歌舞升平、锦绣繁华的长安。孔鸿俊初入大唐驱魔司，顶头上司竟是不久前交过手的龙武军将领李景珑。而他竟然失手将陈氏心灯打碎，心灯进入了李景珑的体内。在那盏灯的光影里，有平康里的灯红酒绿、驱魔司夏日阳光下的梧桐、茫茫塞外的漫天风沙与飞雪、阿泰如清泉般的歌声、莫日根与陆许摘下的清晨树叶、裘永思飞扬的笔锋。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qmcXLMTleDYHIgsijj2brrlhdaD.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qmcXLMTleDYHIgsijj2brrlhdaD.png","language":"en","width":1274,"height":492},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/FB5SBfRu9KeGSilKeZQDTiDPOh.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/FB5SBfRu9KeGSilKeZQDTiDPOh.png","language":"zh","width":251,"height":292},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k5IHzaN2kmeEQaJwb65CimIW61.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k5IHzaN2kmeEQaJwb65CimIW61.png","language":"zh","width":459,"height":537}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kmElJ49MJNj3sQhKv6GrUqWyPVa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kmElJ49MJNj3sQhKv6GrUqWyPVa.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1426},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dbHRopNK0TCeT1lzQSZxjscUUWe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dbHRopNK0TCeT1lzQSZxjscUUWe.jpg","language":"zh","width":960,"height":1280},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/55uxknxL3DXTFt7Ru3WKIu7WteQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/55uxknxL3DXTFt7Ru3WKIu7WteQ.jpg","language":"zh","width":562,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tvsi5XJcq1EwvcvoS6pjOI5R97I.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tvsi5XJcq1EwvcvoS6pjOI5R97I.jpg","language":"zh","width":1025,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iVImuIAZZtEiyIRXGMY9O6ey4vA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iVImuIAZZtEiyIRXGMY9O6ey4vA.jpg","language":"zh","width":960,"height":1280}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https:/